    "Accessory bonuses are calculated from the current enchant level, so restored or created +7+ accessories receive the same bonuses as manually enchanted ones.": "飾品加成依目前強化值計算，因此修復或製作出的 +7 以上飾品與手動強化的加成相同。",
    "Max level: +10. Failure destroys the accessory.": "最高 +10。失敗會摧毀飾品。",
    "changes its base bonuses every week on a 20-week rotation. Its enchantment level and accessory bonuses stay intact. See the guide for this week's stats and the full schedule.": "的基礎加成每週更換，以 20 週輪替。其強化值與飾品加成維持不變。本週數值與完整時程請見指南。",
    "Success Rates (per level)": "成功率（各等級）",
    "Cumulative chance from +0 to +6:": "從 +0 到 +6 的累積機率：",
    "Accessory Bonus Progression": "飾品加成進程",
    "Each enchant level keeps all earlier bonus gains. Low, Medium, and High accessories scale differently.": "每個強化值都保留先前的加成。低、中、高級飾品的成長方式不同。",
    "Low": "低級",
    "MP-focused scaling": "以 MP 為主的成長",
    "Medium": "中級",
    "HP and MR scaling": "HP 與 MR 成長",
    "High": "高級",
    "All resist and regen scaling": "全抗性與回復成長",
    "+6 breakpoint:": "+6 門檻：",
    "SP, MR, and HPR/MPR begin at +6. Low-grade SP increases at +8 and +10, Medium-grade MR increases by +3 per level from +6, and High-grade HPR/MPR increases by +1 per level from +6.": "SP、MR 與 HPR／MPR 從 +6 開始。低級的 SP 在 +8 與 +10 增加，中級的 MR 從 +6 起每級 +3，高級的 HPR／MPR 從 +6 起每級 +1。",
    "Amulets": "護身符",
