    "columns only apply from character creation or a candle reset. Current STR and DEX hit table bonuses both contribute to melee and bow accuracy; original melee hit still comes from original STR, while original ranged hit comes from original DEX.": "欄位只適用於創角或蠟燭重置。目前 STR 與 DEX 的命中表加成都會計入近戰與弓箭命中；初始近戰命中仍來自初始 STR，初始遠距命中則來自初始 DEX。",
