    "Current Regen Cap": "目前回復上限",
    "universal": "通用",
    "Direct-damage magic uses INT in the damage coefficient, not only displayed SP. SP can plateau while INT still improves spell damage. Healing and debuff land rates use separate magic bonus, magic hit, and skill-specific rules.": "直接傷害魔法的傷害係數使用 INT，而不只是顯示的 SP。SP 可能停滯，但 INT 仍會提高魔法傷害。治癒與減益的命中率採用獨立的魔法加成、魔法命中與技能專屬規則。",
    "Orig Magic Hit": "初始魔法命中",
