    "Turn Undead, Mana Drain, healing, summons and elemental damage are established systems. Summoner talents apply only to your living creatures created by Summon Monster, not pets, tamed monsters, another player's summons or summoned elementals. Normal CHA, occupied companion slots, summon selection, lifetime and map restrictions remain. Shared cooldowns belong to the caster, never reset by replacing summons, and do not multiply with summon count. Summons must be visible, on your map and profile, and within the stated circular radius without a wall between you. Destroy keeps its existing repeated-target rules. Nothing here bypasses MR, boss immunity, legal target rules or server action intervals.": "起死回生術、魔力奪取、治癒、召喚與屬性傷害都是既有系統。召喚師天賦只適用於你以召喚怪物製造的存活生物，不含寵物、馴服怪物、其他玩家的召喚獸或召喚的屬性精靈。一般 CHA、已佔用的同伴欄位、召喚選擇、持續時間與地圖限制不變。共用冷卻屬於施法者，不會因替換召喚獸重置，也不隨召喚數量倍增。召喚獸必須可見、在你的地圖與模式中，且在所述的圓形範圍內且中間沒有牆。究極光裂術維持既有的重複目標規則。這裡沒有任何東西能繞過 MR、Boss 免疫、合法目標規則或伺服器動作間隔。",
