    "An Unbroken Thought": "未斷的思緒",
    "A valid Bone Break or Phantasm that fails its chance roll refunds 30% of its paid MP.": "有效的骷髏毀壞或幻想擲骰失敗時，退還支付 MP 的 30%。",
    "Once per 10 seconds shared. No immune-target refund, accuracy increase or longer control.": "共用每 10 秒一次。免疫目標不退還，不增加命中或延長控場。",
