    "Change a formation, empower an ally, or feed the group?": "改變陣形、強化隊友，還是供給全隊？",
    "Tactician capstone": "戰術家頂點",
    "The Right Cube, Right Now": "對的立方，就是現在",
    "Replacing a cube with a different cube type refunds 30% of the new cube's MP cost.": "以不同類型的立方替換現有立方時，退還新立方 MP 消耗的 30%。",
    "Old cube must have existed for 8 seconds; once per 12 seconds. Still only one cube.": "舊立方必須存在 8 秒；每 12 秒一次。仍然只能有一個立方。",
