    "Support capstone": "支援頂點",
    "A Perfect Borrowed Shape": "完美的借來形體",
    "Illusion: Avatar lasts 16 seconds longer on another party member and grants 3 extra melee and bow damage.": "幻覺：化身對其他隊員持續時間延長 16 秒，並額外給予 3 近戰與弓箭傷害。",
    "No self bonus, extra recipients or stacking with another copy of this talent.": "對自己沒有加成、沒有額外對象，也不與另一份此天賦疊加。",
    "Resource capstone": "資源頂點",
    "A Thought Shared": "共享的思緒",
    "When Mind Break transfers MP to you, restore 25% of that amount, up to 8 MP, to the lowest-MP eligible party member within 3 cells.": "心靈破壞轉移 MP 給你時，以該量的 25%（最多 8 MP）恢復 3 格內 MP 最低的符合條件隊員。",
    "Once per 5 seconds; not yourself. Uses MP actually transferred and cannot trigger further talents.": "每 5 秒一次；不包含自己。以實際轉移的 MP 計算，不會再觸發其他天賦。",
    "Mind Break and parties": "心靈破壞與隊伍",
    "Current Illusionist guide": "目前的幻術師指南",
    "Reborn permits one cube per caster. Quake, Shock and Balance have distinct ally/enemy effects; Balance already restores ally HP/MP and drains enemy MP. Mirror Image is dodge, not damage reflection. Mind Break already transfers actual target MP.": "Reborn 每位施法者只允許一個立方。地裂、衝擊與和諧對友方／敵方有不同效果；和諧已會恢復友方 HP／MP 並吸取敵方 MP。鏡像是閃避，不是傷害反彈。心靈破壞已會轉移目標的實際 MP。",
    "Always drawn from our latest class talent proposals. As the ideas evolve, this preview evolves with them.": "永遠取自我們最新的職業天賦提案。想法演進時，這份預覽也會跟著演進。",
    "STILL LINEAGE. STILL REBORN.": "依然是天堂，依然是 REBORN。",
    "More identity.": "更多個性。",
    "The same heartbeat.": "同樣的心跳。",
    "The goal is not to make every character good at everything. It is to make your choices worth talking about.": "目標不是讓每個角色什麼都擅長，而是讓你的選擇值得談論。",
    "Built around your class": "圍繞你的職業打造",
    "Talents would build on existing spells and combat mechanics, not replace your class or grant spells you have not learned.": "天賦會建立在既有的魔法與戰鬥機制上，不會取代你的職業，也不會給你尚未學會的魔法。",
    "Strengths with boundaries": "有界限的強項",
    "Costs, conditions and tradeoffs belong beside the exciting part. Every proposal includes its limitations.": "代價、條件與取捨與令人興奮的部分並列。每個提案都包含其限制。",
    "A conversation before a commitment": "承諾之前的對話",
    "These are design proposals. Numbers, unlocks and interactions still need testing, balancing and implementation. No launch date is promised.": "這些是設計提案。數值、解鎖與互動仍需測試、平衡與實作。沒有承諾上線日期。",
    "HELP SHAPE WHAT COMES NEXT": "幫忙塑造接下來的方向",
    "Which choice would be hardest to give up?": "哪個選擇最難放棄？",
    "Tell us what excites you, what feels too strong, and which choices you would actually make. The best ideas should feel like they belong in Aden.": "告訴我們什麼讓你興奮、什麼感覺太強，以及你實際會做哪些選擇。最好的想法應該像是本來就屬於亞丁。",
    "Join the conversation": "加入討論",
