    "LV": "LV",
    "Seven classes, each with its own way to shape Aden. Discover their abilities, spellbook icons and original spell animations.": "七個職業，各有塑造亞丁的方式。探索他們的能力、魔法書圖示與原版魔法動畫。",
    "SEVEN CLASSES · ONE WORLD": "七個職業 · 一個世界",
    "Steel, endurance and close-range combat.": "鋼鐵、耐力與近身戰鬥。",
