    "Deadly blades and shadow magic.": "致命的刀刃與暗影魔法。",
    "Dragon blood and relentless melee attacks.": "龍之血與無情的近戰攻擊。",
    "Phantasms, cubes and mind-bending magic.": "幻象、立方與扭曲心智的魔法。",
    "{n} SPELLS · EXPLORE →": "{n} 個魔法 · 探索 →",
    "Classic Overview": "經典模式總覽",
    "Classic Has Its Own World": "經典模式有自己的世界",
    "Our Classic server is built as a parallel world inside the same community, not as a Standard shortcut with lower rates. That means Classic players get their own pace, their own economy, and their own boss race while still staying part of the same Lineage1Reborn project.": "我們的經典伺服器是同一個社群內的平行世界，不是倍率較低的標準捷徑。經典玩家有自己的步調、自己的經濟與自己的 Boss 競爭，同時仍是同一個 Lineage1Reborn 專案的一部分。",
    "Same community. Separate progress.": "同一個社群，分開的進度。",
    "Own Pace": "自己的步調",
    "Classic uses its own progression tuning, own drop balance, and own earning speed. It is meant to feel slower, more deliberate, and more self-contained from the start.": "經典有自己的成長調整、掉落平衡與賺取速度。從一開始就設計成更慢、更有意識、更自成一格。",
    "Own Economy": "自己的經濟",
    "Classic is protected from Standard feeding. Items, trading, private shops, and other earning paths are separated so Classic players build their own wealth.": "經典不受標準餵養。道具、交易、個人商店與其他賺取管道都分開，讓經典玩家累積自己的財富。",
    "Own Boss Race": "自己的 Boss 競爭",
    "Classic and Standard each have their own versions of bosses on the same boss cycles, invisible to the other side.": "經典與標準在同樣的 Boss 週期上各有自己版本的 Boss，彼此看不見。",
    "What Stays Separate": "分開的部分",
