    "Classic boss competition": "經典的 Boss 競爭",
    "Classic protection from cross-profile PvP": "經典不受跨模式 PvP 影響",
    "Classic protection from outside buffing and support funnels": "經典不受外部輔助與支援灌注",
    "Classic progression from Standard interference": "經典的成長不受標準干擾",
    "What Stays Shared": "共享的部分",
