    "The Goal": "目標",
    "If you choose Classic, you should feel like you are building something that belongs to Classic players. Not borrowing Standard power. Not shopping through Standard. Not competing with Standard for the same boss pool. Just a slower, cleaner progression path with the same community around it.": "選擇經典的話，你應該感覺自己在打造屬於經典玩家的東西。不借用標準的力量，不透過標準購物，不與標準競爭同一批 Boss。只是一條更慢、更乾淨的成長路，身邊是同一個社群。",
    "Cooking meals grant 15-minute buffs. You can keep one cooking meal and one dessert active at the same time. Fantasy cooking items grant the same buffs as their normal counterparts.": "料理餐點提供 15 分鐘的效果。你可以同時保有一道料理與一道甜點的效果。幻想（特別的）料理的效果與一般版本相同。",
