    "No PvP and no normal EXP or item loss on death in event maps. Pets are welcome. Tap a command to copy it.": "活動地圖內沒有 PvP，死亡也不會損失一般經驗值或道具。歡迎帶寵物。點一下指令即可複製。",
    "The Harvest cycle": "豐收循環",
    "Every 30 minutes, each lane runs three 6-minute encounters in a random order, with 12 minutes of hunting spread between them (at least 2 minutes per gap). Bosses appear near the players, and lantern posts move around the field and change every encounter.": "每 30 分鐘，每條戰線會以隨機順序進行三場 6 分鐘遭遇戰，中間穿插共 12 分鐘的狩獵時間（每段至少 2 分鐘）。Boss 會出現在玩家附近，燈籠柱會在場上移動，每場遭遇戰都不同。",
    "⚔️ Sword Assault": "⚔️ 劍靈突襲",
    "What spawns": "出現什麼",
    "Waves of Red and Green Sword Spirits.": "一波波的紅色與綠色劍靈。",
    "How it scales": "如何調整",
    "Waves are sized to the lane. A new wave arrives when most of the last one is down.": "每波數量依戰線人數調整。前一波大多倒下後，下一波就會到來。",
    "🗼 Tower Invasion": "🗼 高塔入侵",
    "8 waves in Tower order: Zenith Queen, Seer, Vampire, Zombie Lord, Cougar, Mummy Lord, Iris, Knight Vald.": "依傲慢之塔順序共 8 波：潔尼斯女王、幻象眼魔、吸血鬼、殭屍王、黑豹、木乃伊王、艾莉絲、騎士范德。",
    "One boss for every two players in each wave; the next wave comes when the current one falls. Bosses hit at a quarter of their normal strength.": "每波每兩名玩家一隻 Boss；目前這波倒下後下一波才來。Boss 的攻擊力只有正常的四分之一。",
    "🌕 Blood Moon": "🌕 血月",
    "The Headless Horseman, Yahee and Varlok together.": "無頭騎士、火焰之影與炎魔一起登場。",
    "How much punishment they take adjusts to the lane's size, and they hit at half strength.": "牠們能承受的傷害依戰線人數調整，攻擊力為正常的一半。",
    "Between encounters:": "遭遇戰之間：",
    "monsters give normal EXP but no drops. The field refills to about 5 monsters per player (at least 12), close to the entrance.": "怪物給正常經驗值但不掉落。場上會補充到每位玩家約 5 隻（至少 12 隻），靠近入口。",
    "Credit:": "計分：",
    "60 s of your own activity plus 1,000 damage, 800 healing of allies a monster recently hit, or all 3 lanterns. Two credited encounters in one cycle make a Harvest clear.": "自己活動 60 秒，再加上 1,000 傷害、對剛被怪物攻擊的隊友治癒 800，或點亮全部 3 盞燈籠。同一循環內取得兩場計分即為一次豐收完成。",
