    "The host needs 3 Harvest clears; guests need none.": "主持者需要 3 次豐收完成；來賓不需要。",
    "Hosts: 1 run per day per website profile. Guests: 3 entries per day per character.": "主持者：每個網站帳號模式每日 1 次。來賓：每個角色每日 3 次。",
    "4 houses per ruleset. If all are busy, Mephi's Spirit tells you when one frees up.": "每個規則組有 4 間鬼屋。全部使用中時，Mephi 之靈會告訴你何時有空房。",
