    "About every two hours, the Feastkeeper announces a ten-minute public defense at a mainland location. Join at any time, protect the wagon through escalating waves, and earn a Caravan Crate based on meaningful participation and the group's result—not the final hit.": "約每兩小時，宴會管理人會宣布在大陸某地點進行十分鐘的公開防衛戰。隨時可加入，在逐漸增強的敵潮中保護貨車，依實質參與和團隊結果獲得商隊木箱，與最後一擊無關。",
    "Briarback the Glutton": "貪食者荊棘背",
    "At a full Grand Table, Aden confronts a massive bramble-covered harvest spirit. Briarback's minions consume Feast Supplies to strengthen his healing and shield. Meaningful participants who contributed to the feast receive a Bounty Chest; rare chase drops remain separate.": "豐盛餐桌裝滿時，亞丁將面對一隻巨大、布滿荊棘的豐收之靈。荊棘背的手下會消耗宴會物資來強化牠的治癒與護盾。對盛宴有貢獻且實質參與的玩家會獲得賞金寶箱；稀有的追逐掉落另行計算。",
