    "Main progress and daily rewards are tracked by web profile, with Standard and Classic kept separate. Bound progression cannot be funneled through alternate accounts, and public rewards require active participation.": "主要進度與每日獎勵依網站帳號模式追蹤，標準與經典分開。綁定進度無法透過分身帳號集中，公開獎勵需要實際參與。",
