    "Treasure Gremlins are slipping through Aden with stolen riches, strange portals, and a very angry Goblin King close behind. Track them down during the event for a chance to break into short treasure realms filled with goblins, rewards, and timed chaos.": "寶藏葛林帶著偷來的財寶與奇怪的傳送門在亞丁四處流竄，後面還跟著一隻非常生氣的哥布林王。活動期間追捕牠們，就有機會闖進充滿哥布林、獎勵與限時混亂的短暫寶藏領域。",
