    "Toggle monster spell-cast announcements.": "切換怪物施法公告。",
    "Show or hide monster levels.": "顯示或隱藏怪物等級。",
    "Choose the Edoryu of Ronde proc sprite for the Druid character.": "為德魯伊角色選擇 Edoryu of Ronde 的觸發圖像。",
    "Toggle spell-system messages.": "切換魔法系統訊息。",
    "Change the server-wide Stun and Bone Break visual set.": "更換全伺服器的暈眩與骷髏毀壞視覺效果組。",
    "Toggle per-kill damage summaries.": "切換每次擊殺的傷害摘要。",
    "Toggle the optional underwater screen effect; map mechanics remain active.": "切換選用的水底畫面特效；地圖機制照常運作。",
    "Show active bounties, or place an Adena bounty on a player from the same profile.": "顯示進行中的懸賞，或對同一模式的玩家下金幣懸賞。",
    "Invite all eligible online blood pledge members to your party.": "邀請所有符合條件的線上血盟成員加入你的隊伍。",
    "Invite one player to your party.": "邀請一位玩家加入你的隊伍。",
    "Show party display settings. Use mp, cc, or lowhpmp followed by on or off.": "顯示隊伍顯示設定。用 mp、cc 或 lowhpmp 接 on 或 off。",
    "Transfer party leadership to an online party member.": "把隊長轉移給線上的隊伍成員。",
    "Show or hide party members' active pet and summon HP bars.": "顯示或隱藏隊伍成員出戰中寵物與召喚獸的 HP 條。",
    "Open your blood pledge information and online member list.": "開啟你的血盟資訊與線上成員列表。",
    "Show or hide member levels in pledge lists (leaders and sub-leaders).": "在血盟列表顯示或隱藏成員等級（盟主與副盟主）。",
    "Show pledges with points in the active siege.": "顯示在進行中攻城戰有得分的血盟。",
    "List or watch live arena matches, or leave spectator mode.": "列出或觀看進行中的競技場對戰，或離開觀戰模式。",
    "Appoint an eligible member as blood pledge sub-leader.": "指派符合條件的成員為血盟副盟主。",
    "Open an active summon inventory; provide a number when you have several summons.": "開啟出戰中召喚獸的背包；有多隻召喚獸時請指定編號。",
    "Toggle pet and summon damage messages.": "切換寵物與召喚獸的傷害訊息。",
    "Toggle pet EXP messages, including regular and CHA bonus EXP.": "切換寵物經驗值訊息，包含一般與 CHA 加成經驗值。",
    "Show or hide interaction bubbles for your pets and summons.": "顯示或隱藏你的寵物與召喚獸的互動對話框。",
    "Allow or prevent your pets and summons from using melee attacks.": "允許或禁止你的寵物與召喚獸使用近戰攻擊。",
    "Set the HP percentage at which pets and summons automatically use healing potions.": "設定寵物與召喚獸自動使用治癒藥水的 HP 百分比。",
    "Allow or prevent your pets and summons from casting spells.": "允許或禁止你的寵物與召喚獸施放魔法。",
    "Switch to each newly tagged target, or finish tagged targets in order.": "切換到每個新標記的目標，或依序解決已標記的目標。",
    "Allow or prevent pet Taunt talent casts.": "允許或禁止寵物施放挑釁天賦。",
    "Broadcast a birthday greeting for 5,000,000 Adena.": "花 5,000,000 金幣廣播生日祝福。",
    "Control the profanity filter for chat you receive.": "控制你收到的聊天內容的髒話過濾。",
    "Show your ignore list, or toggle a character's exclusion; ignored chat also covers that character's game account.": "顯示你的拒絕名單，或切換某個角色的拒絕狀態；被拒絕的聊天也涵蓋該角色的遊戲帳號。",
    "Control shared global chat on Classic-profile characters.": "控制經典模式角色的共用全體頻道。",
    "Play the personal joke visual effect.": "播放個人搞笑視覺特效。",
    "Broadcast a love greeting for 1,000,000 Adena.": "花 1,000,000 金幣廣播愛的告白。",
    "Roll from 1 through the chosen maximum and show the result nearby and to your party.": "從 1 到指定最大值擲骰，結果會顯示給附近玩家與你的隊伍。",
    "Vote in an active server poll.": "在進行中的伺服器投票中投票。",
    "Refresh visible objects on your screen without teleporting.": "不用傳送就重新整理畫面上可見的物件。",
    "Toggle automatic dissolving using the item rules saved on your website Game Accounts page.": "依照你網站「遊戲帳號」頁儲存的道具規則，切換自動溶解。",
    "Import bookmarks from one of your own website-linked characters.": "從你網站綁定的其中一個角色匯入記憶座標。",
    "Show the ID of the last NPC HTML window, useful when reporting dialogue problems.": "顯示上一個 NPC HTML 視窗的 ID，回報對話問題時很有用。",
    "Teleport to a player's active private shop while both characters are in the Giran Trading Zone.": "當雙方角色都在奇岩交易區時，傳送到玩家營業中的個人商店。",
    "Show rune slots. Use -runeslot 3 purchase to unlock slot 3 when eligible.": "顯示符文槽。符合條件時用 -runeslot 3 purchase 解鎖第 3 槽。",
    "Send private-shop receipt copies to another character, or turn the copies off.": "把個人商店的收據副本寄給另一個角色，或關閉副本。",
    "Sort now, control login auto-sort, or apply a supporter website inventory layout.": "立即整理、控制登入時自動整理，或套用贊助者網站背包版面。",
    "Show elemental stone pile information (staff only).": "顯示屬性石堆資訊（僅限工作人員）。",
    "Move up to five clear cells directly ahead without crossing obstacles, map boundaries, or teleport tiles.": "往正前方最多移動五格空地，不會穿過障礙物、地圖邊界或傳送格。",
    "Teleport to Pandora, SKT, Giran, Werldern, Oren, Orc Town, Silent Cavern, Gludio, Silveria, or Behimous.": "傳送到潘朵拉、銀騎士村、奇岩、威爾登、歐瑞、Orc Town、Silent Cavern、古魯丁、西爾維利亞或貝希莫斯。",
    "Show or apply Dragonscale polymorph and arrow options (Dragonscale tier).": "顯示或套用龍鱗變身與箭矢選項（龍鱗階級）。",
    "Apply an equipment set saved on the website.": "套用網站上儲存的裝備組合。",
    "Toggle the supporter miss sprite.": "切換贊助者的 Miss 圖像。",
