    "CHA & Pet/Summon Guide": "CHA 與寵物／召喚獸指南",
    "Pet and summon limits are determined by your effective CHA, class bonus, and the total pet cost of active pets/summons. Pets, tames, and summons all share the same control pool.": "寵物與召喚獸的上限由你的有效 CHA、職業加成，以及目前寵物／召喚獸的總消耗決定。寵物、馴服怪物與召喚獸共用同一個控制額度。",
    "Effective CHA = CHA + inventory CHA bonus + class bonus.": "有效 CHA = CHA + 背包 CHA 加成 + 職業加成。",
    "Each qualifying CHA item only counts once per unique slot, whether equipped or just in your inventory.": "每件符合條件的 CHA 道具每個部位只算一次，不論是裝備中或只放在背包。",
    "Available control = Effective CHA − total pet cost of active pets/summons.": "可用控制 = 有效 CHA − 目前寵物／召喚獸的總消耗。",
