    "This uses your real CHA only: base, level-up stats, elixirs, and equipped/item-set CHA.": "只採用你的真實 CHA：基礎值、升級加點、萬能藥與裝備／套裝的 CHA。",
    "Inventory CHA does not count": "背包 CHA 不計入",
