    "Pledges & community": "血盟與社群",
    "How to create, manage, and join pledges (clans).": "如何建立、管理與加入血盟。",
    "Create a pledge": "建立血盟",
    "You must be a Prince/Princess (royal) with no existing pledge.": "你必須是尚未擁有血盟的王族（王子／公主）。",
    "Speak to a Pledge Master NPC in town to register a pledge name (an adena fee usually applies).": "到城裡找血盟管理 NPC 登記血盟名稱（通常需要金幣費用）。",
    "Choose a clear pledge name; avoid symbols or spacing that players can’t type.": "選一個清楚的血盟名稱；避免玩家打不出來的符號或空格。",
    "Invites & joining": "邀請與加入",
    "Only the leader (or ranks with invite rights) can invite new members.": "只有盟主（或具邀請權限的階級）可以邀請新成員。",
    "Invited players must be pledge-free; have them accept promptly before the invite expires.": "被邀請者必須沒有血盟；請他們在邀請過期前儘快接受。",
    "If a player was in a pledge recently, they may need to wait briefly before joining another.": "若玩家最近才離開血盟，可能需要稍等一段時間才能加入另一個。",
    "Pledge ranks": "血盟階級",
    "Leader (Prince/Princess):": "盟主（王子／公主）：",
    "full control of invites, ranks, titles, and pledge management.": "完全掌控邀請、階級、稱號與血盟管理。",
    "Sub-leader:": "副盟主：",
    "must be royal, level 45+, and have the level 45 quest complete. Can invite, kick (not leaders/sub-leaders), title members, and adjust most ranks.": "必須是王族、45 級以上，且完成 45 級任務。可邀請、踢出（盟主與副盟主除外）、授予稱號，並調整大部分階級。",
    "Guardian/Public:": "守護騎士／一般：",
    "standard member ranks for trusted members.": "給信任成員的一般階級。",
    "Probation:": "見習：",
    "default on join; no pledge warehouse access.": "加入時的預設階級；無法使用血盟倉庫。",
    "Pledge size limits (royal level)": "血盟人數上限（依王族等級）",
    "Member caps scale with the pledge leader's level. Standard pledges reach 25 members at level 70 and Classic pledges reach 20 at level 65. At level 75, the leading royal earns 5 additional slots: 30 Standard or 25 Classic members, including when a subleader accepts the invitation.": "成員上限隨盟主等級提高。標準血盟在 70 級達到 25 人，經典血盟在 65 級達到 20 人。盟主 75 級時再多 5 個名額：標準 30 人或經典 25 人，由副盟主接受邀請時也適用。",
    "A dash means the cap is unchanged from the previous row in that column.": "破折號表示該欄上限與上一列相同。",
    "Royal level": "王族等級",
    "Standard max": "標準上限",
    "Classic max": "經典上限",
    "Pledge merge (absorb another clan)": "血盟合併（吸收另一個血盟）",
    "Clan merge is enabled on this server.": "本伺服器開放血盟合併。",
    "Invite the other clan's leader (royal) and have them accept to merge their entire clan into yours.": "邀請對方的盟主（王族），對方接受後整個血盟就會併入你的血盟。",
    "The merging clan must have no castle or house, and your pledge must have enough member slots.": "被合併的血盟不能擁有城堡或房屋，且你的血盟必須有足夠的名額。",
    "The merged clan is removed (including its emblem), so use this with care.": "被合併的血盟會被移除（包含盟徽），請謹慎使用。",
    "Alliances": "同盟",
    "Alliance system is enabled. Clan leaders level 25+ can request an alliance by facing another clan leader.": "同盟系統已開放。25 級以上的盟主面向另一位盟主即可提出同盟。",
    "Both clans must not be at war and must not already be in an alliance.": "雙方血盟都不能處於戰爭狀態，也不能已有同盟。",
    "Alliances are between two clans; leaving dissolves the alliance for both.": "同盟限兩個血盟；任一方退出即解除同盟。",
    "Alliance chat uses": "同盟頻道使用",
    "when allied.": "，需在同盟狀態。",
    "Pledge chat": "血盟頻道",
    "Pledge chat uses": "血盟頻道使用",
    "and is available to pledge members.": "，血盟成員皆可使用。",
    "Guardian chat uses": "守護騎士頻道使用",
    "and is for pledge members with guardian-level privileges.": "，供具守護騎士權限的成員使用。",
    "and reaches allied pledges when your pledge is in an alliance.": "，血盟處於同盟時也能傳到同盟血盟。",
    "Pledge perks": "血盟福利",
    "Pledge, guardian, and alliance chat channels for organized groups.": "血盟、守護騎士與同盟頻道，方便組織行動。",
    "Pledge warehouse access for non-probation members; withdrawals require a title unless you're the leader.": "非見習成員可使用血盟倉庫；除盟主外，提領需要有稱號。",
    "Pledge emblems show on capes and the pledge list.": "盟徽會顯示在披風與血盟列表上。",
    "Alliances and wars for coordinated PvP and sieges.": "同盟與戰爭，用於協調 PvP 與攻城。",
    "Emblems & identity": "盟徽與識別",
    "Use a 16x12, 24-bit BMP for your emblem. In MS Paint: open your source image (GIF/PNG/etc.), click Resize > Pixels, set width to 16, then save as 24-bit BMP.": "盟徽請使用 16x12 的 24 位元 BMP。在小畫家中：開啟來源圖片（GIF／PNG 等），點「重新調整大小」>「像素」，寬度設為 16，再另存為 24 位元 BMP。",
    "Save the BMP in your Lineage root folder. Log in on your royal, click the handshake icon (bottom right) > Bloodpledge Options and upload it. Small, clean art looks best on capes and the pledge list.": "把 BMP 存到天堂的根目錄。用王族登入，點右下角的握手圖示 > 血盟選項並上傳。小而乾淨的圖在披風與血盟列表上效果最好。",
