    "A custom EXP curve, daily combat EXP pacing, Einhasad support, and level 77 as the practical progression ceiling.": "自訂經驗值曲線、每日戰鬥經驗值節奏、殷海薩 支援，以及以 77 級作為實際的成長上限。",
    "Revised class formulas, more meaningful control resistance, spell criticals, and class-specific runes.": "修訂過的職業公式、更有意義的控制抗性、魔法爆擊，以及職業專屬符文。",
