    "1x EXP, 1x Adena, and 1x item drops": "1 倍經驗值、1 倍金幣、1 倍道具掉落",
    "Classic and Standard use profile-specific monster ownership, drops, events, trade rules, trade areas, castle treasuries, rankings, and many reward limits.": "經典與標準各自使用自己的怪物歸屬、掉落、活動、交易規則、交易區、城堡金庫、排名，以及許多獎勵上限。",
    "Direct trade is restricted to the same profile. Cross-profile party invitations are blocked.": "直接交易只限同一模式。跨模式的組隊邀請會被擋下。",
    "Standard characters cannot supply Classic characters with Standard buffs or healing.": "標準角色不能提供經典角色標準模式的輔助魔法或治癒。",
    "Standard characters cannot freely attack Classic characters. If a Classic character initiates against a Standard character, that Standard character receives a 30-second retaliation window; doorway abuse and formal combat/war contexts have their own guarded exceptions.": "標準角色不能隨意攻擊經典角色。若經典角色先對標準角色出手，該標準角色會獲得 30 秒的反擊時間；門口卡位濫用與正式決鬥／宣戰情境有各自的例外處理。",
    "Classic has its own spawn/drop variants where content needs separate tuning;": "需要分開調整的內容，經典有自己的出沒／掉落版本；",
    "identifies many Classic boss and monster variants.": "標示許多經典版的 Boss 與怪物。",
    "Some web-account limits are deliberately separate by profile, allowing one Standard and one Classic entitlement rather than letting one side consume the other side’s allowance.": "部分網站帳號上限刻意依模式分開，讓標準與經典各有一份額度，而不是讓一邊吃掉另一邊的額度。",
    "This separation is broader than a simple rate switch. It prevents Standard farming, buffs, and economy from becoming shortcuts for Classic progression.": "這樣的區隔不只是切換倍率而已，它避免標準模式的打寶、輔助魔法與經濟變成經典模式成長的捷徑。",
    "Rework. Standard and Classic share the same underlying level difficulty curve; their profile EXP rates are applied afterward. Most of levels 5–47 use approximately half of the stock-sty…": "重做。標準與經典共用同一條底層等級難度曲線，再套用各自模式的經驗值倍率。5–47 級大多只需要原版約一半的經驗值…",
