    "use reliable one-minute-class windows rather than fragile client-only state.": "改用可靠的一分鐘級持續時間，而不是脆弱的純客戶端狀態。",
    "Rework. Shock Stun is no longer only a flat database roll: Equal-level base chance is approximately 55% before resistance and rune bonuses. Each attacker level above or below the target c…": "重做。衝擊之暈不再只是資料庫裡的固定機率：同等級的基礎機率約 55%，抗性與符文加成另計。攻擊者每高於或低於目標一級，機…",
    "is no longer only a flat database roll:": "不再只是資料庫裡的固定機率：",
    "Equal-level base chance is approximately 55% before resistance and rune bonuses.": "同等級的基礎機率約 55%，抗性與符文加成另計。",
