    "Each point of target stun resistance removes 1.5 chance points, rounded to the nearest whole chance point after the total resistance is scaled.": "目標每點暈眩抗性扣 1.5 點機率，總抗性換算後四捨五入到整數機率點。",
    "Rune of Thunder Verdict adds +2 chance points; Grand Thunder Verdict adds +5.": "雷霆裁決符文 +2 點機率；強力雷霆裁決 +5 點。",
    "This makes level, build, and stun resistance all relevant without making the result guaranteed.": "這讓等級、配置與暈眩抗性都有影響，但結果不會是必定命中。",
    "Rework. Counter Barrier uses the Taiwan-style level-sensitive chance model, with a current ceiling of 40%. Its counter behavior is protected from unrelated Immune to Harm reduction so the…": "重做。反擊屏障採用台版的等級敏感機率模型，目前上限 40%。它的反擊行為不受無關的聖結界減傷影響，所以…",
    "uses the Taiwan-style level-sensitive chance model, with a current ceiling of 40%. Its counter behavior is protected from unrelated": "採用台版的等級敏感機率模型，目前上限 40%。它的反擊行為不受無關的",
    "reduction so the reflected attack remains meaningful.": "減傷影響，所以反射的攻擊仍然有意義。",
    "Addition. Rune of Rebound makes Bounce Attack a one-handed build option: while Bounce is active, one-handed physical hits have a 10% chance to produce one extra hit. Two-handed weapons do…": "新增。反彈符文讓尖刺盔甲成為單手配置的選項：尖刺盔甲啟動時，單手物理攻擊有 10% 機率多打一下。雙手武器不會…",
    "Rune of Rebound makes": "反彈符文讓",
    "a one-handed build option: while Bounce is active, one-handed physical hits have a 10% chance to produce one extra hit. Two-handed weapons do not trigger it, and the extra hit cannot recursively trigger another Rebound.": "成為單手配置的選項：尖刺盔甲啟動時，單手物理攻擊有 10% 機率多打一下。雙手武器不會觸發，多出來的那一下也不會再連鎖觸發反彈。",
    "Elf is more deliberately split between bow pressure, elemental support, control, and fire melee.": "妖精更明確地分成弓箭壓制、屬性輔助、控制與火屬性近戰幾條路線。",
    "Buff: Base ER grows at level / 6, compared with stock level / 8. Rework: Bow damage beyond the base DEX threshold uses Reborn’s 1.02 DEX coefficient, keeping DEX valuable while controll…": "強化：基礎 ER 以等級 / 6 成長，原版是等級 / 8。重做：超過基礎 DEX 門檻的弓箭傷害採用 Reborn 的 1.02 DEX 係數，讓 DEX 仍有價值，同時控制…",
    "Base ER grows at": "基礎 ER 以",
