    "Mage keeps the stock spellbook identity, but its scaling, criticals, healing, control, and equipment progression are substantially expanded.": "法師保留原版的魔法書定位，但成長、爆擊、治癒、控制與裝備進程都大幅擴充。",
    "Addition/Buff. Direct damage spells can critically hit. Base spell critical chance is 10%, plus original-stat magic critical and Dragon Magic Eye bonuses. Low-level spells crit for up to…": "新增／強化。直接傷害魔法可以爆擊。基礎魔法爆擊率 10%，再加上初始能力值的魔法爆擊與龍之魔眼加成。低階魔法最高可爆到…",
    "Addition/Buff.": "新增／強化。",
    "Direct damage spells can critically hit.": "直接傷害魔法可以爆擊。",
