    "Low-level spells crit for up to 1.5x damage; the multiplier tapers by spell level to 1.2x for level-10 magic.": "低階魔法最高可爆到 1.5 倍傷害；倍率隨魔法等級遞減，10 級魔法為 1.2 倍。",
    "Valakas-style armor effects can provide another valid critical path.": "巴拉卡斯系列的防具效果可以提供另一條有效的爆擊途徑。",
