    "Buff/Rework. Healing scales meaningfully with INT and can critically heal through the same 10% base critical framework. Rune of Grace can duplicate eligible direct healing onto another wo…": "強化／重做。治癒會隨 INT 有意義地成長，並能透過同樣的 10% 基礎爆擊機制爆擊治癒。恩典符文可以把符合條件的直接治癒複製到另一位受傷…",
