    ", anti-heal states, and other modifiers remain part of the final calculation.": "、反治癒狀態與其他修正仍會納入最終計算。",
    "Rework. Turn Undead uses a class-aware, INT-sensitive roll: Mages receive the favorable class die. Non-Mage access, including Elf or rune-provided attempts, uses a weaker class die. Above…": "重做。起死回生術採用依職業、受 INT 影響的判定：法師使用有利的職業骰。非法師的使用，包括妖精或符文提供的施放，使用較弱的職業骰。超過…",
    "uses a class-aware, INT-sensitive roll:": "採用依職業、受 INT 影響的判定：",
