    "Shock Stun has a 15% chance to become Mass Shock Stun. Each eligible enemy within 6 cells of the target rolls its own stun resistance.": "衝擊之暈有 15% 機率變成群體衝擊之暈。目標 6 格內每個符合條件的敵人各自擲暈眩抗性。",
    "Kill comfort": "擊殺便利",
    "After killing a monster, gain a 10-second bravery-style movement-speed comfort buff. It has a 30-second cooldown and is meant for players who do not yet have reliable access to bravery-type run speed.": "擊殺怪物後獲得 10 秒勇敢式移動速度的便利效果。冷卻 30 秒，給還沒有穩定勇敢類跑速來源的玩家。",
    "Death protection": "死亡保護",
    "2.5% chance to prevent EXP loss on death. If it does not prevent the loss, death EXP loss is reduced by 25% under level 50, 17.5% under level 60, and 12.5% under level 70.": "死亡時 2.5% 機率不損失經驗值。若未防止，死亡經驗值損失在 50 級以下減少 25%、60 級以下減少 17.5%、70 級以下減少 12.5%。",
    "5% chance to prevent EXP loss on death. If it does not prevent the loss, death EXP loss is reduced by 50% under level 50, 35% under level 60, and 25% under level 70.": "死亡時 5% 機率不損失經驗值。若未防止，死亡經驗值損失在 50 級以下減少 50%、60 級以下減少 35%、70 級以下減少 25%。",
