    "Lesser Heal, Heal, Greater Heal, Full Heal, and Heal Pledge real spell casts have a 10% chance to heal another nearby friendly party or pledge member. If no other eligible wounded ally is available, the extra heal lands on the original target. Does not trigger from scroll casts.": "實際施放初級治癒術、中級治癒術、高級治癒術、全部治癒術與體力回復術時，有 10% 機率再治癒附近另一位隊伍或血盟成員。若沒有其他符合條件的受傷隊友，額外治癒會落在原目標上。卷軸施放不觸發。",
    "Thebes chaser": "底比斯追擊",
