    "While Bounce Attack is active, physical hits with one-handed weapons have a 10% chance for one extra hit and the Bounce visual. Two-handed weapons do not trigger Rebound. Extra hits cannot trigger Rebound. Make Knights Great Again!": "尖刺盔甲生效時，單手武器的物理命中有 10% 機率多打一下並顯示尖刺特效。雙手武器不觸發反彈。額外的攻擊不會再觸發反彈。讓騎士再次偉大！",
    "Weapon visuals": "武器特效",
