    "To reduce low-level padding while keeping high-level picks meaningful, kill points scale by the defeated character's level. The Royal bonus applies on top.": "為了減少用低等級角色灌分，同時讓擊殺高等級目標有意義，擊殺分數依被擊殺角色的等級調整。王族加成另外計算。",
    "Level 52-55:": "52-55 級：",
