    "crown points, tower points, kill points, defender priority, then pledge name.": "王冠分、高塔分、擊殺分、守方優先，最後是血盟名稱。",
    "Live score command": "即時分數指令",
    "during an active regular siege to see current pledge standings. It shows only pledges above 0 points and includes live ownership-time points.": "可在一般攻城進行中查看目前各血盟排名。只顯示 0 分以上的血盟，並包含即時的持有時間分數。",
    "Important PvP spell note": "重要 PvP 魔法說明",
    "Cancel Magic": "魔法相消術",
    "in PvP does not fully wipe most buffs here. It suppresses most numeric buff effects for": "在本伺服器的 PvP 中不會完全清除大多數輔助魔法，而是壓制大部分數值型效果",
    "15 seconds": "15 秒",
    ", then those effects return automatically. Haste/brave, morph, and invis-style effects are still stripped immediately.": "，之後效果會自動恢復。加速／勇敢、變身與隱形類效果仍會立即被解除。",
    "Tactics and tips": "戰術與提示",
    "Capture established control:": "奪取穩固的控制權：",
    "fresh crown flips earn little or nothing, while taking a castle held for 10+ minutes earns the full capture value.": "剛翻轉的王冠幾乎沒有分數，奪下持有 10 分鐘以上的城堡才有完整的奪取分。",
    "Protect holders:": "保護持有者：",
    "every 5 minutes of ownership adds reliable points.": "每持有 5 分鐘就穩定加分。",
    "Protect your Royal:": "保護你的王族：",
    "killing an enemy Royal adds a 10-point bonus to the normal level-based kill value.": "擊殺敵方王族會在一般等級擊殺分之外再加 10 分。",
