    "Build, save, copy, and load equipment sets on the website and in game. Silver includes 2 sets, Gold 5, and Dragonscale 12 per character.": "在網站與遊戲內建立、儲存、複製與載入裝備組合。每角色白銀 2 組、黃金 5 組、龍鱗 12 組。",
