    "Supporter benefits focus on cosmetics, convenience, and recognition. They do not add exclusive combat stats or Adena generation. However you choose to be part of Reborn, thank you for being here.": "支持者福利以外觀、便利與認可為主，不會增加專屬戰鬥數值或金幣產出。無論你以什麼方式成為 Reborn 的一分子，謝謝你在這裡。",
